23
00:01:34,733 --> 00:01:39,512
In this lesson, we'll find the largest and
smallest values a function takes.

24
00:01:40,633 --> 00:01:45,731
The extreme value theorem says a
continuous function on a closed interval

25
00:01:45,731 --> 00:01:49,572
