62
00:04:41,700 --> 00:04:46,031
In this lesson, we'll use the second
derivative to see how a graph bends.

63
00:04:47,167 --> 00:04:53,016
If f double prime is positive, f is
concave up, like a cup. If it's negative,

64
00:04:53,016 --> 00:04:55,295
